WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
This type of copy does not have a unique BOSS

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,120
Otherwise, you can clear the level quickly

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,880
Its difficulty lies in the rules and the weirdness of each site

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,800
Can it also kill BOSS like the Rou family?

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,040
It's summer now

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,960
But your clothes don't seem like summer clothes

7
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,440
You are very observant

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,240
Then let me add some common sense to you.

9
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,080
This is a wearing item from the Points Mall

10
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,960
The props you buy will be in the system backpack

11
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,480
But if it is a wearable prop

12
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,840
It will be automatically worn every time you enter the instance.

13
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:22,960
Wait until you have enough points

14
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,440
There is one thing you can buy. I will remember it. Thank you.

15
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:47,880
Can I still hide here?

16
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,240
Go to the wall
